        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International, Distressed Cabinet Pull Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWabi-sabi is a Japanese design aesthetic that finds beauty in the imperfect and impermanent. RK International's Distressed Rustic Pull plays with that idea in a very modern way. The casting process has left tiny imperfections in this pull that bring a sense of time to the otherwise almost commercial looking piece. It is available in 3 sizes: a 4 inch center to center, a 6 inch center to center, and a 8 inch center to center. The Distressed Cabinet Pull with Oval Mounts is the perfect way to bring Wabi-sabi to your home in a very elegant way.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-809:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-810:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-811:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CP-811-finishes.jpg?v=1704354618\" width\"599\" height=\"181\" border=\"0\" atl=\"RKI International CP-809 Cabinet Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
